    "title": "pandas.Period.weekofyear — pandas 2.2.3 documentation",
    "status": 200,
    "markdown": "# pandas.Period.weekofyear#\n\n- Period.weekofyear#\n- Get the week of the year on the given Period. \n  - Returns:\n    - int\n See also \n  - `Period.dayofweek`\n  - Get the day component of the Period.\n  - `Period.weekday`\n  - Get the day component of the Period.\n Examples >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-03-11\", \"h\") >>> p.weekofyear 10 >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-02-01\", \"D\") >>> p.weekofyear 5 >>> p = pd.Period(\"2018-01-06\", \"D\") >>> p.weekofyear 1",
    "markdown_length": 437,
